        <article class="lc-review-card">
          <div class="lc-review-card__stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          <h4 class="lc-review-card__title">So far so good</h4>
          <p class="lc-review-card__body">So far I am very happy with the quality of the wine fridge and the service from LeCavist. I had originally ordered the smaller 168 bottle fridge, but found that it was too small for my needs. I contacted LeCavist and asked if I could upgrade to the larger 248 bottle model, and they were happy to assist. The fridge was swapped over and my new 248 bottle fridge has been working almost flawlessly since. When I say &quot;almost&quot;, I have has a small issue with a failing LED display, but LeCavist are currently working on a solution to this and are keeping me up to date with the progress. So far I am…</p>
          <footer class="lc-review-card__footer">
            <span class="lc-review-card__author">— James</span>
            <time class="lc-review-card__date">Nov 2024</time>
          </footer>
        </article>
        <article class="lc-review-card">
          <div class="lc-review-card__stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          <h4 class="lc-review-card__title">A great wine fridge at a great price</h4>
          <p class="lc-review-card__body">I have been looking for a good quality wine fridge for a long time and have been put off by the price of many competitors.  The LeCavist brand met  my requirements on quality and price.   After a conversation with Pierre I decided on the 246 Single Zone (I was comparing to the 168 Single Zone), and I am happy with the decision as it has given me capacity to continue to grow my collection.  As this fridge is for my white and sparkling I have some trouble with the variation in bottle sizes and will need to purchase a few more racks.  I am not sure if I like the LED lighting yet, but the…</p>
          <footer class="lc-review-card__footer">
            <span class="lc-review-card__author">— Ben van Parreren</span>
            <time class="lc-review-card__date">Jul 2023</time>
          </footer>
        </article>
        <article class="lc-review-card">
          <div class="lc-review-card__stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          <h4 class="lc-review-card__title">High Quality, Professional Service &amp; Products.</h4>
          <p class="lc-review-card__body">Being truthful, I&#39;d been looking for a wine fridge for a long while; but hadn&#39;t been convinced of many product&#39;s quality or worthiness for the $&#39;s being asked. Simply, I wanted to procure a reliable, high end, quality product - basically &quot;alota wine fridge&quot; - for the $&#39;s being out laded.  Finally, I took the step &amp; made contact with Pierre, Lecavist&#39;s Owner / Manager.  Thus after reading many Lecavist owners positive reviews, a 30-minute education with Pierre (who is a gentleman) and a few emails, I happily placed an order for the elegant &amp; sharp price point, Service Series 268 bottle, single…</p>
          <footer class="lc-review-card__footer">
            <span class="lc-review-card__author">— Garry Clarke</span>
            <time class="lc-review-card__date">Feb 2023</time>
          </footer>
        </article>
        <article class="lc-review-card">
          <div class="lc-review-card__stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          <h4 class="lc-review-card__title">Fabulous wine cabinet that ticks all the boxes</h4>
          <p class="lc-review-card__body">I should have purchased one of these ages ago to store some old Rockfords and other wines. Does a fantastic job and once set the desired temperature remains constant. 248 Bordeaux bottles is optimistic, I&#39;ve reached nearly capacity with 164 bottles although that is a mix of Australian and French bottles and several magnums. I definitely recommend this if you&#39;re in the market for a quality wine cabinet.</p>
          <footer class="lc-review-card__footer">
            <span class="lc-review-card__author">— Freemo</span>
            <time class="lc-review-card__date">Feb 2026</time>
          </footer>
        </article>
        <article class="lc-review-card">
          <div class="lc-review-card__stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          <h4 class="lc-review-card__title">LeCavist Leading the Way</h4>
          <p class="lc-review-card__body">The ordering process online was easy to navigate through. The delivery process was excellent with updates on status sent regularly. The delivery staff were awesome and had the fridge set up in the place I needed with no packaging left at the house. Wine fridge display is easy to operate. Overall design is excellent and is now storing my investment. Value for money cant be beaten!</p>
          <footer class="lc-review-card__footer">
            <span class="lc-review-card__author">— Clinton</span>
            <time class="lc-review-card__date">Oct 2024</time>
          </footer>
        </article>
        <article class="lc-review-card">
          <div class="lc-review-card__stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          <h4 class="lc-review-card__title">Make sure you get the wine cabinet/fridge that best suits your needs. if you only need a single z...</h4>
          <p class="lc-review-card__body">The staff at the Good Food and Wine Show Sydney, were helpful, and helped us choose exactly what we needed (248 bottle single zone), we only keep reds in it. The price was awesome, as is the quality of the product, Delivery was prompt, and we were kept informed during the entire process.</p>
          <footer class="lc-review-card__footer">
            <span class="lc-review-card__author">— Mark Koosache</span>
            <time class="lc-review-card__date">Jul 2024</time>
          </footer>
        </article>
        <article class="lc-review-card">
          <div class="lc-review-card__stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          <h4 class="lc-review-card__title">Love the size of it!</h4>
          <p class="lc-review-card__body">With a hot summer starting to build I decided to bite the bullet and get myself a decent sized wine fridge to facilitate my growing collection. LeCavist was recommended by my brother and it has not let me down. Very happy with the size, quietness and the blue lighting feature!</p>
          <footer class="lc-review-card__footer">
            <span class="lc-review-card__author">— Wilkmandoo</span>
            <time class="lc-review-card__date">Jan 2025</time>
          </footer>
        </article>
        <article class="lc-review-card">
