          <h4 class="lc-review-card__title">Fantastic wine fridge</h4>
          <p class="lc-review-card__body">This is our third wine fridge and it&#39;s beautiful. The design is top notch (although I prefer wooden shelves vs metal ones but so far the shelves are ok). The fridge runs very quietly and has been perfect since we got it delivered. Excellent value product.</p>
