        <article class="lc-review-card">
          <div class="lc-review-card__stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="lc-review-card__body">I purchased this earlier in the year after returning from a South Australian winery tour. I predominantly drink red, so the single temperature zone is not an issue. The cabinet has ample storage, but the shelves can get heavy to slide under the weight of multiple bottle layers. I purchased two extra shelves which not only reduced the sliding weight, but also made it easier to arrange my collection. The blue internal led lights are an elegant touch. I will likely purchase another another as my collection grows. A brilliant product!</p>
