          <p class="lc-review-card__body">Purchased a large wine fridge and could not be any happier with it. It is exactly the way they described it as it fits all types of wine bottles and magnums as well. Will be purchasing another in the near future and also recommending to  family and friends. Get on board if you are looking for a wine fridge to store and age your wines.  A big Thank You to the sales representative for his great knowledge and advice on what was suitable for my wine needs.</p>
