          <div class="lc-review-card__stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="lc-review-card__body">Purchased 2 x 248 Bottle Single Zone Wine Cabinets just after Christmas. Arrived within 2 weeks, delivery guys were careful to ensure no damage during installation, made sure units were in position and level, turned units on, checked operation, lights and doors. Very classy looking cabinets, now to fill them up with our precious collection. Very happy so far!</p>
